ances uninformative.\n* The best model by validation RMSE is used for the final submission.","metadata":{}},{"id":"802a3fe5-5376-4ef5-b17e-0b7b385c8dfe","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 11. Final model and submission\nThe best model (by validation RMSE) is refit on **all** de-duplicated training data and used to predict the test set.","metadata":{}},{"id":"d8edda4c-ceab-4cea-bc16-0bc13a915529","cell_type":"code","source":"best_name = comp.iloc[0][\"Model\"]\nbest_est = tuned.get(best_name) or fitted[best_name]\nfrom sklearn.base import clone\nfinal = clone(best_est).fit(Xall, y)\npred = np.expm1(final.predict(X_test))\nsub = pd.DataFrame({\"id\": full_test[\"id\"].astype(int), \"price\": pred})\nsub.to_csv(\"submission.csv\", index=False)\nprint(\"Best model:\", best_name, \"| rows:\", len(sub), \"| NaNs:\", sub.price.isna().sum())\nsub.head()","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T11:21:51.067401Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T11:21:51.067745Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T11:22:07.036967Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T11:21:51.067712Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T11:22:07.036168Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Best model: Random Forest | rows: 10000 | NaNs: 0\n","output_type":"stream"},{"execution_count":18,"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":"   id         price\n0   0   4546.776859\n1   1   8252.857646\n2   2   4959.136996\n3   3  56692.128826\n4   4  48978.278751","text/html":"<div>\n<style scoped>\n    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe thead th {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n</style>\n<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n      <th></th>\n      <th>id</th>\n      <th>price</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th>0</th>\n      <td>0</td>\n      <td>4546.776859</td>\n